        "body": "From 05:00–14:00 UTC on November 1, 2026, Instant Payouts to cards experienced elevated failure rates due to issuer-bank maintenance affecting payment networks, primarily impacting the US and Canada. This issue is now resolved, and payment processing has returned to normal.",
